    "title": "Royal Farms Rewards",
    "description": "Welcome to the Royal Farms ROFO Rewards App.  We are your new go to for earning points and redeeming them for fresh, never frozen, World-Famous fried chicken (along with many other customer favorites)! \r\nFeatures: \r\n\u2022        New members will get a free any size free coffee after signing up. \r\n\u2022        In store, earn 2 Royalty Points per dollar spent \r\n\u2022        Order ahead for pickup and delivery, and earn 2 Royalty Points per dollar spent\r\n\u2022        At the pumps, earn 1 point per gallon spent\r\n\u2022        Redeem your Royalty Points for your choice of 16 of our most popular food and drink options\r\n\u2022        Upgrade to ROFOPay and save up to .10 cents off per gallon\r\n\u2022        Find a Royal Farms near you \r\n\u2022        Receive special free offers on your favorite items throughout the year, just being a Rofo Rewards member!",
